@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Menghapus Data Semester (Tata Usaha)
actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Semester ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses sidebar "Semester"
UI -> C: 2. Request semester page
C -> DB: 3. Get semester list
DB --> C: 4. Return semester data
C --> UI: 5. Load semester page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan halaman semester dengan daftar semester

== Hapus Semester ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik tombol "Hapus" pada baris semester
UI -> C: 8. Request delete confirmation
C --> UI: 9. Show confirmation dialog
UI --> TU: 10. Tampilkan jendela konfirmasi penghapusan

alt Konfirmasi hapus
    TU -> UI: 11. Klik tombol "Hapus" di jendela konfirmasi
    UI -> C: 12. Handle delete confirmation
    C -> DB: 13. Delete semester data
    DB --> C: 14. Semester deleted successfully
    C -> DB: 15. Get updated semester list
    DB --> C: 16. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 17. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 18. Tutup jendela konfirmasi + tampilkan daftar semester terbaru
    note right
    Data semester berhasil dihapus
    end note
else Batal hapus
    TU -> UI: 11. Klik tombol "Batal" di jendela konfirmasi
    UI -> C: 12. Cancel delete request
    C --> UI: 13. Close confirmation dialog
    UI --> TU: 14. Tutup jendela konfirmasi + kembali ke halaman semester
    note right
    Data semester tidak dihapus
    end note
end
@enduml